<title>SWEDEN: Foreningsbanken/Swedbank say discussing merger.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken/Swedbank say discussing merger.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish banks Foreningsbanken and Swedbank said on Monday they were discussing a possible merger.  </p>
<p>Trading in the shares of the two banks was suspended early Monday on the Stockholm bourse.</p>
<p>&quot;In connection with the halt in trade in Foreningsbanken and Swedbank, the respective companies wish to announce that discussions are ongoing between Foreningsbanken and Swedbank about the forms of a possible merger,&quot; the two banks said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
